{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1000_p", "source_sha256": "32972291b4cd1df6e1d1fdf73a7cd63566f5bdb7bc3bd16e662c8550a4e2dad1", "ja": "（初公演を成功させ、アイドルとしてスタート地点に\n立った恵美。今日は一対一でのミーティングだ）", "zh": "（成功完成首场公演、作为偶像站上起点的惠美。今天是和她一对一的谈话）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "87b6366eba080f917177b6fe9bdbdc89ddb5a7d91b86073d8e95c04b3efb2a25", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ～。\nねね、今日ってどんな話すんの？　次の仕事の話？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦～  \n那个，今天要聊什么？是下一个工作的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1002_p", "source_sha256": "751fc7a6b0ee8b145e760e2351712c3c534bb5acc3bafa501197a2d81846b6ab", "ja": "うん。これから恵美が、アイドルとしてしてみたい事を\n聞かせてほしいんだ。何か希望はあるか？", "zh": "嗯。我想听听惠美今后作为偶像，\n有什么想尝试的事情。你有什么心愿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "af7b529cd02f240be83ffcf022dd2e5f558743bb04a75cf3a293429fc4d70743", "ja": "ええっ！？　急に言われてもな～……うーん……。\n特に、思いつかないかも？", "zh": "诶！？突然这么问，我也想不出来啊～……嗯……。  \n好像没什么特别想做的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c22a3c761521d74cb0e2945a131ce2750747fbc6fdbcdf7d5aabeb4b8924887e", "ja": "そ、そうか。\nそれじゃ、劇場で困ってる事とかはないか？", "zh": "这、这样啊。\n那么，在剧场里有没有遇到什么困难？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "ed991eab6e5bb14f931b2348a8e08e61895c0ed37464df10ce3cefc9725c52ba", "ja": "困ってること？　ううん、全然！\nアタシ、劇場のみんなのコト気に入ってるし♪", "zh": "困扰的事？没有，完全没有！\n我很喜欢剧场的大家呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "f6236410bce2d66e050384872a53af2a2f26a548d5323d15ebf41d74af71a4df", "ja": "最初はさ、アイドルになりたい子とかって、アタシとは\n全然違う世界の人なのかな？って思ったんだけど……。", "zh": "一开始嘛，我还以为那些想当偶像的孩子，\n跟我完全是不同世界的人呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "4e5aca281f6cb62c8525432e1afa80ce8daff379e215ba0228c8c830c54bef0f", "ja": "劇場のみんなって、なんかもういい子ばっかでさ～！\nすっごくホッとしちゃった♪", "zh": "剧场里的大家，感觉全都是些特别好的孩子～！\n让我一下子放心多了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "3cd51e150c86e6c77758d612d7f6672bb6f4c7990b3262465726ae5e2d23ac07", "ja": "だからアタシ、今のカンジでけっこう満足してるかも？\nこないだの初公演も、すっごく楽しかったしね♪", "zh": "所以，我可能还挺满足于现在这样吧？\n上次的首次公演也特别开心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d2e71587da5319b5544d625edc2da6ae68378f45af198a9eb92dc24e9c97cda3", "ja": "劇場のみんなと仲良くやれてるなら、何よりだよ。\nそういえば恵美は、地元にも友達が多いんだったな。", "zh": "只要能和剧场的大家相处融洽，那就比什么都好。\n说起来，惠美在老家也有很多朋友吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1010_p", "source_sha256": "44591149c6e2bf3759a7630b3802451390884433e09c22d3b4d6941762d8be0d", "ja": "機会があれば、友達を劇場に招待してもいいんだぞ？\n大勢は無理だけど、2、3人とか……。", "zh": "要是有机会，也可以邀请朋友来剧场嘛？  \n人太多可不行，不过……2、3人左右……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "a89b2d14a6f886be5fc085e92219c08a2f9f76d0e5d2fe7c3b8dee7597d4cccf", "ja": "あっ……う、うん。\nそうだよね、地元の友達……。", "zh": "啊……嗯、嗯。\n说得也是，家乡的朋友……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9c98af1108aae987de649551034900f45ac6169d10ef6ea99ab9c501392b39a1", "ja": "どうかしたのか？", "zh": "怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "3460e76def396fab3ef9c46e3930bb573b5f504447573af9374ddb4d51090351", "ja": "あ、ううん、なんでもない！\nえっと、大したことじゃないからさ。", "zh": "啊，没什么，什么事都没有！\n那个，真的不是什么大不了的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1014_p", "source_sha256": "66f44c80ba20ba10c88164876a140fd5893a1d4b96bbcc312d379dad626a28ed", "ja": "本当に大した事じゃないと思ってるなら、\n話せるよな？", "zh": "如果你真的觉得没什么大不了的，就说出来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "443930516225f391a739d5904f1a0c37b01ecc11a8157933c80cd605d836ba71", "ja": "{$P$}……\nその言い方、ズルい～……うう。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n你这样说，很狡猾啊～……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "20119ffd9d0a4a09fe46bd82abdcd1d595fae55989468fcbfcda85b41dcd31ea", "ja": "えっと、何から話せばいいのかな……。アタシ、\n中学から一緒で、よく遊んでた友達がいるんだけど。", "zh": "呃，该从哪里说起好呢……我有一个从初中起就一直在一起、经常一起玩的朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "a440eef6628771f5e83f1b36b909e9fb7e5c6edfe095d0c37f9a578c48cdeea7", "ja": "読モを始めたころから、なんていうか……\nちょっと、うまくいかなくなっちゃったんだよね。", "zh": "从开始当读者模特那时候起，该怎么说呢……\n关系就变得有点不太顺利了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "baeffa71d496a70394e3bec2eff669ad850063a71fc12f17ef30a291c9c43c86", "ja": "別に、悪口とか言われたわけじゃないんだけど。\nちょっとだけ、避けられてた……みたいな？", "zh": "也不是被人说了什么坏话。\n只是，好像稍微被疏远了一点……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f3000158f8acb1d7bb217f1c770d9781e3dc84da39ab78b037b0e1a536baec00", "ja": "そうか……理由は、なんだったんだ？", "zh": "这样啊……那是为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "fedfb0c4db074fb11970e2cda7652817170e1971beedef8561cc052e881375ad", "ja": "その子、ずっと芸能界に憧れてたんだよね。なのに\nアタシが、先にそういうコト始めちゃったから……。", "zh": "那孩子一直都很憧憬演艺圈。可是，因为我先开始做这种事了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "1b917cb9d10ec7fa4def219239594fa02be81f9f765916ed15ee1da252aa0fe8", "ja": "あっ、でもね！　読モずっと続けてたら、\n段々応援してくれるようになったんだよ！", "zh": "啊，不过呢！我一直坚持做读者模特，她也渐渐开始为我加油了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "d2b0ee73ee28a81d961f3992fccdf80d93797afb5e225674ebbda3ea15874082", "ja": "アタシ、それがすっごく嬉しかったんだよね～。\n頑張ってるの、認めてもらったみたいな感じしない？", "zh": "我当时真的特别开心呢～感觉就像自己的努力得到了认可一样，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1023_p", "source_sha256": "a98b8b845b1a6e39d35be7cc026c42d31cafafba12720016561429cef5412654", "ja": "うん、それは嬉しいよな。\nよかったじゃないか、恵美。", "zh": "嗯，确实会很开心啊。\n这不是挺好的嘛，惠美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "c9ed18ef50bd4743babd03a8af549c7956a46fd1b4f9053e6f877791469ec78d", "ja": "そうなの！　……だから{$P$}に\nスカウトされて、アイドルになろうって決めた時もさ。", "zh": "就是这样！……所以当初被{$P$}发掘，决定成为偶像的时候，我也是啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1025_020meg", "source_sha256": "9a0f28ab4fbfedb53f66f242a82635a97b5c4f6ce799d2d4970492f4506ba4f4", "ja": "一番に、その子に話したんだ。読モみたいに、応援して\nくれるかなって思ってたんだけど……言われちゃった。", "zh": "我第一个就跟她说了。本以为她也会像支持我做读者模特那样为我加油的……结果却被她说了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "543e741ee92cd6195f1a8ef7700a9426cfaeb8304d5cdbf23fd33457af3044d4", "ja": "「アイドルなんて、今まで興味なかったくせに！」\n……って。他の子は、応援してくれたんだけど……。", "zh": "“明明你以前对当偶像根本就没兴趣！”\n……她这么说了。其他人明明都支持我来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1027_p", "source_sha256": "285846ac528a0ccbc177647a4d2c49fe7e0b82d9051c9f937a8303f482516570", "ja": "そんな事があったのか……。\nそれは辛かったな。", "zh": "原来发生过那样的事啊……\n那一定很难受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "570f7f2d314abd431c765993dce765a793172e1e968e00a12e48ba695fd37007", "ja": "うん……ま、でも大丈夫だよ{$P$}！\n今言ったみたく、応援してくれる友達もいるしね！", "zh": "嗯……不过，没关系的，{$P$}！\n就像刚才说的那样，也有支持我的朋友嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1029_p", "source_sha256": "78b0a3adaafb9517efe26fe1f9a91285dd300ea02a7238bded3ca7ab1f02609e", "ja": "本当に大丈夫だったら、\nそんな顔で話さないと思うけどな。", "zh": "如果真的没事，我觉得你就不会摆出那副表情说话了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1030_020meg", "source_sha256": "9b0cf5f6410bed525a460c0678e2373ca24df58b47edd687ee876e4fb7442f5e", "ja": "ええっ！？　あ、アタシ、そんなヘンな顔してる！？\nうう……。", "zh": "诶！？我、我真的露出那么奇怪的表情了吗！？\n呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1031_020meg", "source_sha256": "c87e1d81275e611cd28502a0448e1ea65ff834b9eaf1ae55ce1915a3e114e6cb", "ja": "……あのさ、{$P$}。\nもうちょっとだけ、話聞いてもらっても、いい……？", "zh": "……那个，{$P$}。\n可以再听我说一会儿吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1032_020meg", "source_sha256": "b4eee708e307d8d25641308489231710be1b1500b0277781f2ae05408251a56d", "ja": "アタシ、いろいろ考えたけど、よくわかんなくて……\nこういうのって、どうしたらいいのかな……。", "zh": "我想了很多，可还是想不明白……\n这种事，到底该怎么办才好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1033_p", "source_sha256": "4163dd76fa67cb65a13ff8ba483af520c0b091733865ab5df346167e63215f06", "ja": "そうだな。厳しいかもしれないけど……人を変える事は\nできないんだ。だから、恵美が変わるしかないかもな。", "zh": "是啊。虽然可能有点困难……但人是无法改变的。所以，或许只能由惠美自己改变了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1034_p", "source_sha256": "f8554d60ad6670933ee5931a192db55e7f341fdb800dd709550ce649a8f81406", "ja": "読モに真剣だったように、恵美はアイドル活動にも\n真剣なんだって事を、表現し続けるしかない。", "zh": "就像惠美当初认真对待读者模特的工作一样，她对偶像活动也同样认真。她只能继续表现出这一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_004_1035_020meg", "source_sha256": "b535b3096f013fd626e1206932a44d9c281a1ee8ce3baeffdc38c84213c526d5", "ja": "でも……でもだよ？\nもし頑張って、それでもダメだったら？", "zh": "但是……但是啊？\n如果已经努力了，却还是不行的话呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
